  "notes": "Smoke-only battery-preview wake classification correction. Fixes the 2.3.113 regression where setup time could complete the shortened startup timer while an ordinary charge-level tap was still electrically HIGH, causing an unintended full power-on. The battery level is still shown immediately, but the startup timer now begins only after that frame is visible and requires Wake to remain continuously asserted for a separate 100 ms confirmation window; any release keeps the interaction as a battery preview and returns the tester to sleep. Includes the protected two-button manual-density entry and exclusive two-LED crossfade from 2.3.113. Twin Button firmware content remains unchanged.",
